# Papers are NEVER committed. ADR-0005 section 3: records, not PDFs.
# Most published papers are not redistributable and several in the seed set are
# vendor or conference material. The access field points at a DOI, an arXiv id,
# or a local path. The seed PDFs live at D:/Data/Harold/EvidenceBasedDB/Papers,
# deliberately outside this repository.
Papers/
Books/
GitHubRepos/
References/
*.pdf

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The store is a build output; the committed EXPORT is the artifact.
# ADR-0004 section 2: SQLite is the store of record, and a deterministic text
# export is regenerated from it and committed, so a fact changing value shows up
# in REVIEW. Every defect that motivated this system was silent.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Local Claude state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
